{"path":"string/multibyte/char8_t","title":"char8_t","titleHtml":"char8_t","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/string/multibyte/char8_t","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"char8_t is an unsigned integer type used for UTF-8 and is the same type as unsigned char.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/string/multibyte\"><code>&lt;uchar.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw1\">typedef</span> <span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> char8_t<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">char8_t</span> is an unsigned integer type used for UTF-8 and is the same type as <span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;uchar.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    char8_t str<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> u8<span class=\"st0\">\"zß水🍌\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// or \"z\\u00df\\u6c34\\U0001f34c\"</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw100\">size_t</span></a> str_sz <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw4\">sizeof</span> str<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// sizeof *str == 1 by definition</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw851\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"%zu UTF-8 code units: [ \"</span>, str_sz<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw100\">size_t</span></a> n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> str_sz<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>n<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw851\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"%02X \"</span>, str<span class=\"br0\">[</span>n<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw851\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>11 UTF-8 code units: [ 7A C3 9F E6 B0 B4 F0 9F 8D 8C 00 ]</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-23\">\n<ul><li> C23 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2024): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.30 Unicode utilities &lt;uchar.h&gt; (p: 410)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/types\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span><span>Fundamental types</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/multibyte","title":"Null-terminated multibyte strings"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"char8_t","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. char8_t is an unsigned integer type used for UTF-8 and is the same type as unsigned char."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"References"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":["C23"],"wordCount":112,"codeBlockCount":2}
